---
description: Global defaults, always active
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- English only (code, comments, commits, explanations) unless explicitly told otherwise.
- Multi-file output: list filenames first, then each file. Never invent structure not requested.
- Zero unused code (imports/vars/methods). Extract logic used 2+ places; no premature abstraction.
- Every function: JSDoc (what/inputs/outputs).
- If unsure and a reference implementation exists, copy its pattern — don't invent a new one.
